#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:196
msgid "Image uploads"
msgstr "Subidas de imágenes"

#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:198
msgid ""
"Applies to images uploaded from now on. Images already in the library do not "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Se aplica a las imágenes que se suban a partir de ahora. Las que ya están en "
"la biblioteca no cambian."

#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:206
msgid "Maximum upload size (MB)"
msgstr "Tamaño máximo de subida (MB)"

#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:212
msgid ""
"The server limit still applies if it is lower. 0 = only the server limit."
msgstr ""
"Si el límite del servidor es menor, manda ese. 0 = solo el límite del "
"servidor."

#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:221
msgid "Scale down images larger than (px)"
msgstr "Reducir las imágenes mayores de (px)"

#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:227
msgid "Longest side. WordPress default: 2560. 0 = never scale down."
msgstr "Lado más largo. El de serie de WordPress: 2560. 0 = no reducir nunca."

#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:236
msgid "Original file"
msgstr "Archivo original"

#: modules/uploads/includes/class-uploads.php:242
msgid ""
"Delete the original after scaling it down (only the scaled copy is kept)."
msgstr ""
"Borrar el original después de reducirlo (solo se guarda la copia reducida)."

#: modules/uploads/module.php
msgctxt "module name"
msgid "Image uploads"
msgstr "Subidas de imágenes"

#: modules/uploads/module.php
msgctxt "module description"
msgid ""
"Phone photos can be uploaded (up to 20 MB by default); WordPress scales them "
"down to 2560 px and only the scaled copy is kept on disk."
msgstr ""
"Deja subir fotos del móvil (hasta 20 MB por defecto); WordPress las reduce a "
"2560 px y en el disco solo se guarda la copia reducida."

#: modules/webp/module.php
msgctxt "module description"
msgid ""
"Image sizes generated from JPEG and PNG uploads are saved as WebP (quality "
"75)."
msgstr ""
"Los tamaños que se generan al subir un JPEG o un PNG se guardan en WebP "
"(calidad 75)."

