msgid "Translated front page (WPML)"
msgstr "Portada traducida (WPML)"

#: modules/wpml-front-page/module.php
msgctxt "module description"
msgid ""
"With WPML, /en/ shows the translated front page instead of the latest posts. "
"Without WPML it does nothing."
msgstr ""
"Con WPML, /en/ enseña la portada traducida en vez de las últimas entradas. "
"Sin WPML no hace nada."

